ears for January to February, the most of any pair since 1951. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, January to February ran 50% of normal and March to April ran 158%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 48% and February to March at 141%. Grid 22972 had its driest year in 1953 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
